# Firebase service-account credentials (Admin SDK / FCM HTTP v1)
# These files contain a raw private key and grant project-wide push authority.
# They must NEVER be committed. Reference them by absolute path from .env
# (FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PATH) or from GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS.
service-account.json
serviceAccount.json
service_account.json
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
*serviceAccountKey.json
